 "schemes.apiToken.description: \"API token authentication (recommended). Specify a token generated in the app settings in the X-Cybozu-API-Token header. To target multiple apps, list tokens separated by commas. Because tokens are scoped per app, some APIs such as user/organization/group management (User API) and space administration require password authentication.\"",
