 "schemes.oauth2.type: \"oauth2\"",
 "schemes.passwordAuth.description: \"Password authentication. Specify the Base64-encoded value of `login-name:password` in the X-Cybozu-Authorization header. Use it for APIs that cannot be executed with an API token (User API, space administration, etc.). Intended for server-side use; do not enter credentials into a shared or public Try console.\"",
